# MDX

Follow skills **mdx** and **poteto-mdx** when applicable.

- **@mdx-js/mdx** (or @mdx-js/rollup / @mdx-js/loader / @next/mdx) required in product wiring
- No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` without `mdx-rg-allow` + rationale; prefer MDX/JSX children or sanitized markdown (react-markdown + rehype-sanitize)
- No `evaluate` / `evaluateSync` of dynamic / user-controlled MDX without `mdx-rg-allow` + rationale; prefer static `.mdx` imports from trusted authors
- No `rehype-raw` / `rehypeRaw` without `rehype-sanitize` / `rehypeSanitize` in the same file (or allow); remark/rehype plugins can reopen XSS
- Required product gates: `mdx-rg-gate` + `mdx-hotpath-gate` + `mdx-mdx-gate`. Do not disable checks to force green.
- Prove compile/build of trusted MDX where product needs it, not "wiring pass" alone

Repeated review smell twice on an MDX product: encode into lint/CI/skill, not more prose.
